# =============================================================================
# Root .gitignore — projectKarangTaruna (monorepo)
# =============================================================================

# ----- Non-code / pipeline docs (keep out of VCS) -----
.obsidian
.opencode
memory
README.md

# ----- node_modules di SEMUA subfolder (node_modules/ tanpa slash-) -----
# (tanpa slash di awal/akhir agar cocok di level mana pun)
node_modules

# ----- Build output di semua subfolder -----
dist
dist-ssr

# ----- Environment variables — JANGAN commit secret -----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ----- OS / editor artifacts -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
.vscode
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ----- Logs & test coverage -----
*.log
npm-debug.log*
coverage

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CATATAN:
# 1. `server/` TIDAK dikecualikan utuh — backend wajib ikut commit supaya bisa
#    di-deploy nanti. Hanya `server/node_modules` & `server/.env*` yang
#    dikecualikan lewat pola `node_modules` & `.env.*` di atas (berlaku global).
# 2. `shared/` TIDAK boleh dikecualikan — folder ini adalah single source of
#    truth data pengurus yang di-import kedua frontend via alias `@shared`.
#    Tanpa `shared/` di commit, build Vercel UserUI & DashboardUI GAGAL resolve
#    alias. (File konfigurasi deploy terpisah; lihat README / memory/10-deploy.md)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
